id: GO-SEC-010
title: Hardcoded credentials in Go
category: security
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .go
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ _test.go
patterns:
  - regex: (?i)(password|passwd|secret|token|api_key|apikey)\s*[:=]\s*"[^"]{8,}"
    message: Potential hardcoded credential detected
fix: Use environment variables or a secrets manager (e.g. Vault)
